type: software
title: "heatstroke-wbgt-japan: two-stage DLNM analysis of WBGT and heat-related emergency ambulance dispatches across Japan, 2015-2023"
abstract: "Analysis code and archived machine-readable outputs for a two-stage distributed lag non-linear model with multivariate meta-analysis of the association between daily maximum wet-bulb globe temperature and heat-related emergency ambulance dispatches across the 47 Japanese prefectures in three periods (2015-2019, 2020-2021, 2022-2023)."
